# No letter-spacing

Do not set `letter-spacing`. Pond uses Allo variable with `opsz`, which already adjusts glyph spacing for the rendered size. Manual tracking fights that and looks wrong.

```css
/* Bad */
.title {
  font-size: 18px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

/* Good */
.title {
  font-size: 18px;
}
```

Never add negative tracking on titles/headings “for polish,” and never add positive tracking on labels for the same reason. Leave spacing to the font.
